---
/**
 * Static homepage preview for the full visual dropper guide.
 * Keep the illustration educational: the glass dropper itself is unmarked.
 */
---

<section id="dose" class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-y border-outline-variant/30">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
      <figure class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/60 bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 botanical-shadow">
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="relative flex h-64 w-16 flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-12 w-9 rounded-t-full bg-primary shadow-md"></div>
            <div class="z-10 h-3 w-6 rounded-t-sm border border-outline bg-surface-container-highest"></div>
            <div class="relative h-48 w-7 overflow-hidden rounded-b-xl border-x border-b border-outline/70 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface/80 via-white/40 to-surface/90 shadow-inner">
              <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-t from-secondary/90 via-secondary/70 to-secondary/50">
                <div class="absolute -top-1.5 inset-x-0 h-3 rounded-[50%] bg-secondary/80"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-1 z-20 w-1 rounded-full bg-white/60"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="h-6 w-2.5 rounded-b-md border-x border-b border-outline/70 bg-surface/70"></div>
          </div>

          <ol aria-label="Approximate reference positions" class="flex h-48 flex-col justify-between">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-xs font-bold text-primary">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-5 bg-secondary"></span>
              Full
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-xs font-bold text-primary">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-5 bg-secondary"></span>
              Three-quarter
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-xs font-bold text-primary">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-5 bg-secondary"></span>
              Half
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-xs font-bold text-primary">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-5 bg-secondary"></span>
              Quarter
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
          A simple view of an unmarked dropper and its approximate reference positions.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-stack-md">
        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4">
          <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary font-bold">
            VISUAL DROPPER GUIDE
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary">See the liquid level more clearly.</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3 font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            <p>The Botanica glass dropper is unmarked.</p>
            <p>Our visual guide shows quarter, half, three-quarter and full reference positions so you can compare the liquid level in the dropper.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-outline-variant/40 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-2 max-w-[38ch]">
            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
              The full guide also includes an approximate calculator for the 25 mg and 50 mg bottles.
            </p>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant/80">
              This guide is an approximate reference. It is not a dosing recommendation or medical advice.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/how-to-use#dose"
            class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-on-primary transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
          >
            Open the visual guide
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
